{"id": "244335", "name": "מציאת וקטור קורדינאטות ב-C^2", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "mat_2", "params": ["n"], "body": "matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]) + %i *rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]) + %i *rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1]))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון הבסיס הסדור הבא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B = (v_1,v_2)\\)</span> ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{C}^2\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ v_1 ={{CT:0}} , v_2 ={{CT:1}} \\]</p><p>ונתון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u \\in \\mathbb{C}^2\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[u = {{CT:2}}.\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את וקטור הקואורדינטות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([u]_B\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([u]_B=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-complex\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: את היחידה המדומה \\(i\\) מזינים באות <code dir=\"ltr\">i</code> (אפשר גם <code dir=\"ltr\">%i</code>), וכפל מסמנים בכוכבית. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">3-2*i</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "invert(matA) . vec", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה לא נכונה.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "matA", "n", "vec"], "nvariants": 50}